    <div>mizu o nomu koto ni shimasu</div>
    <div>I decide to drink water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Decide doing</strong></div>
    <div><strong>koto ni shiteimasu</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">事 に しています</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲む<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">事にしています</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomu koto ni shiteimasu</div>
    <div>I decide drinking water (as a rule)</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Be decided to do</strong></div>
    <div><strong>koto ni narimasu</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">事 に 成ります</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲む<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">事に成ります</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomu koto ni narimasu</div>
    <div>It will be decided that I will drink water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Supposed to do</strong></div>
    <div><strong>koto ni natteimasu</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">事 に 成っています</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲む<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">事に成っています</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomu koto ni natteimasu</div>
    <div>I am supposed to drink water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Plain negative style</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>(a)nai</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">あない</span></div>
    <div>verb stem-<strong>u</strong> => verb stem-<strong>anai</strong></div>
    <div>verb stem-<strong>au</strong> => verb stem-<strong>wanai</strong></div>
    <div>verb stem-<strong>tsu</strong> => verb stem-<strong>tanai</strong></div>
    <div>verb stem-<strong>su</strong> => verb stem-<strong>sanai</strong></div>
    <div>verb stem-<strong>ru</strong> => verb stem-<strong>nai</strong></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Plain negative past style</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>(a)nakatta</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">あなかった</span></div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Plain negative command</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nai de kudasai</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ない で 下さい</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲ま<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ないで下さい</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomanai de kudasai</div>
    <div>Don't drink the water!</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Plain negative command (softer)</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nai desu yo</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ない です よ</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲ま<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ないですよ</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomanai desu yo</div>
    <div>(Please) don't drink the water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Without doing</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nai de</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ない で</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">車を見<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ないで</span>買いました</div>
    <div>kuruma o minai de kaimashita</div>
    <div>car [object] see not [with] bought</div>
    <div>I bought the car without seeing it</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Negative request</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nai de hoshii desu</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ない で 欲しい です</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲ま<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ないで欲しいです</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomanai de hoshii desu</div>
    <div>I want you not to drink the water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Have to do / must do</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nakereba narimasen</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">なければ 成りません</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲ま<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">なければ成りません</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomanakereba narimasen</div>
    <div>I/you must drink the water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Don't have to do</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nakutemo ii desu</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">なくても 良い です</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲ま<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">なくても良いです</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomanakutemo ii desu</div>
    <div>I/you don't have to drink the water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Should not do</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nai hō ga ii desu</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ない 方 が 良い です</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲ま<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ない方が良いです</span></div>
    <div>mizu o nomanai hō ga ii desu</div>
    <div>I/you should not drink the water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>While doing</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nagara</strong> / <strong>aida ni</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ながら/間 に</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲み<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ながら</span>新聞を読みます</div>
    <div>mizu o nominagara shinbun o yomimasu</div>
    <div>water [object] drink-while newspaper [object] read</div>
    <div>I read the newspaper while drinking water</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">Aが水を飲んでいる<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">間に</span>Bは新聞を読んでいます</div>
    <div>A ga mizu o nondeiru aida ni B wa shinbun o yondeimasu</div>
    <div>A [subject] water [object] drinking while B [subject] newspaper [object] reading</div>
    <div>B is reading the newspaper while A is drinking the water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>While not doing</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nai uchi ni</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ない 内 に</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲み<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">ない内に</span>新聞を読みます</div>
    <div>mizu o nominai uchi ni shinbun o yomimasu</div>
    <div>water [object] drink-not while newspaper [object] read</div>
    <div>I read the newspaper while not drinking water</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>If / when doing</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>tara</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">たら</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">(若し)水を飲ん<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">だら</span>新聞を読みます</div>
    <div>(moshi) mizu o nondara shinbun o yomimasu</div>
    <div>if water [object] drank-if newspaper [object] read</div>
    <div>If I drink the water I will read the newspaper</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>If / when not doing</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>nakattara</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">なかったら</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">水を飲ま<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">なかったら</span>新聞を読みます</div>
    <div>mizu o nomanakattara shinbun o yomimasu</div>
    <div>water [object] drank-not-if newspaper [object] read</div>
    <div>If I don't drink the water I will read the newspaper</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Passive style</strong></div>
    <div>verb-<strong>rareru</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">られる</span></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">牛乳は猫に<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">飲まれます</span></div>
    <div>gyūnyū wa neko ni nomaremasu</div>
    <div>milk-[object] cat-[subject] by drink-[polite]</div>
    <div>The milk is drunk by the cat</div>
</div>
